"{\n \"url\": \"https://www.duas.org/dua-faraj-dua-azumal-bala-imam-mahdi.html\",\n \"title\": \"Salat for Great Calamities\",\n \"meta\": {\n  \"Type\": \"SALAT-NAMAZ\",\n  \"Attributed to\": \"Imam Mahdi (atfs)\",\n  \"Purpose\": \"Removing Calamities, Ask for needs\"\n },\n \"segCount\": 68,\n \"missTR\": 2,\n \"missEN\": 2,\n \"totalArChars\": 3118,\n \"segments\": [\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"\",\n   \"en\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"إِلَهِيْ عَظُمَ الْبَلَاءُ وَبَرِحَ الْخَفَاءُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Ilahi ‘azuma’l-bala’u wa bariha’l-khafa’\",\n   \"en\": \"O my Lord! The calamity has aggravated; the absence prolonged;\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَانْكَشَفَ الْغِطَاءُ وَانْقَطَعَ الرَّجَاءُ ،\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa’nkashafa’l-ghita’u wa’nqata‘a’r-raja’\",\n   \"en\": \"The curtain of modesty has been lifted; hope has been curtailed;\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَضَاقَتِ الْأَرْضُ وَمُنِعَتِ السَّمَاءُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa daqati’l-ardu wa muni‘ati’s-sama’\",\n   \"en\": \"The earth has been narrow; and sky has been denied.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَأَنْتَ الْمُسْتَعَانُ وَإِلَيْكَ الْمُشْتَكَي\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa anta’l-musta‘anu wa ilayka’l-mushtaka\",\n   \"en\": \"And You are the One from whom help is sought and complaints are made\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ عَلَيْكَ الْمُعَوَّلُ فِيْ الشِّدَّةِ وَالرَّخَاءِ،\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa ‘alayka al-mu‘awwalu fi’sh-shiddati wa’r-rakha’\",\n   \"en\": \"And in You we trust in the times of difficulty.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَي مُحَمَّدٍ وَّآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Allahumma salli ‘ala Muhammad wa ali Muhammad\",\n   \"en\": \"O Allah! Send blessings upon Muhammad (S) and the progeny of Muhammad (S),\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"أُوْلِي الْأَمْرِ الَّذِيْنَ فَرَضْتَ عَلَيْنَا طَا عَتَهُمْ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Uli’l-amri’l-ladhina faradta ‘alayna ta‘atahum\",\n   \"en\": \"The possessors of authority whose obedience you have enjoined upon us\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ عَرَّفْتَنَا بِذَالِكَ مَنْزِلَتَهُمْ ، فَفَّرِجْ عَنَّا بِحَقِّهِمْ فَرَجاً عَاجِلاً قَرِيْباً كَلَمْحِ الْبَصَرِ أَوْ هُوَ أَقْرَبُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa ‘arraftana bidhalika manzilatahum fafarrij ‘anna bi-haqqihim farajan ‘ajilan qariban kalamhi’l-basari aw huwa aqrab\",\n   \"en\": \"And by that made us aware of their position. Then make open for us, by their truth, an immediate opening, immediate as a wink or sooner.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَامُحَمَّدُ يَاعَلِيُّ يَاعَلِيُّ يَامُحَمَّدُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Ya Muhammadu ya ‘Aliyyu ya Muhammad\",\n   \"en\": \"O Muhammad! O ‘Ali! O ‘Ali! O Muhammad!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"ِكْفِيَانِيْ فَإِنَّكُمَا كَافِيَانِ وَ انْصُرَانِيْ فَإِنَّكُمَا نَاصِرَانِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Ikfiyani fainnakuma kafiyani wa’n-surani fainnakuma nasiran\",\n   \"en\": \"Suffice me both of you as both of you are sufficient.Help me—two of you—for you are my helpers.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَامَوْلَانَا يَاصَاحِبَ الزَّمَانِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Ya mawlana ya sahiba’z-zaman\",\n   \"en\": \"O our Master, O Master of the Time!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَلْغَوْثَ اَلْغَوْثَ اَلْغَوْثَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Al-ghawtha’l-ghawtha’l-ghawth,\",\n   \"en\": \"Help! Help!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"أَدْرِكْنِيْ أَدْرِكْنِيْ أَدْرِكْنِيْ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Adrikni adrikni adrikni\",\n   \"en\": \"Rescue me! Rescue me! Rescue me!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَلسَّاعَةَ اَلسَّاعَةَ اَلسَّاعَةَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"As-sa‘ata’s-sa‘ata’s-sa‘ah\",\n   \"en\": \"This moment! This moment! This moment!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَلْعَجَلَ اَلْعَجَلَ اَلْعَجَلَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Al-‘ajala’l-‘ajala’l-‘ajal\",\n   \"en\": \"Hasten, hasten, hasten!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا أَرْحَمَ لرَّاحِمِيْنَ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّآلِهِ الطَّا هِرِيْنَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Ya arhama’r-rahimina bi-haqqi Muhammad wa alihi’t-tahirin\",\n   \"en\": \"O Most Merciful of the Merciful,For the sake of Muhammad (S) and his holy progeny.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"\",\n   \"en\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَللَّهُمَّ عَظُمَ ٱلْبَلاَءُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"allahumma `azuma albala'u\",\n   \"en\": \"O Allah, unbearable is our tribulation!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَبَرِحَ ٱلْخَفَاءُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa bariha alkhafa'u\",\n   \"en\": \"The hidden has been disclosed!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَٱنْكَشَفَ ٱلْغِطَاءُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa inkashafa alghita'u\",\n   \"en\": \"The cover has been exposed!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَضَاقَتِ ٱلأَرْضُ بِمَا وَسِعَتِ ٱلسَّمَاءُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa daqat al-ardu bima wasa`at alssama'u\",\n   \"en\": \"The earth has become too narrow to carry that which could be embraced by the sky.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَإِلَيْكَ يَا رَبِّ ٱلْمُشْتَكَىٰ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa ilayka ya rabbi almushtaka\",\n   \"en\": \"To You, my Lord, is the complaint\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَعَلَيْكَ ٱلْمُعَوَّلُ فِي ٱلشِّدَّةِ وَٱلرَّخَاءِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa `alayka almu`awwalu fi alshshiddati walrrakha'i\",\n   \"en\": \"and in You is the trust in sorrow and in joy.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\",\n   \"tr\": \"allahumma salli `ala muhammadin wa ali muhammadin\",\n   \"en\": \"O Allah, send blessings to Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"ٱلَّذينَ أَمَرْتَنَا بِطَاعَتِهِمْ\",\n   \"tr\": \"alladhina amartana bita`atihim\",\n   \"en\": \"whom You have commanded us to obey,\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَعَجِّلِ ٱللَّهُمَّ فَرَجَهُمْ بِقَائِمِهِمْ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa `ajjil allahumma farajahum biqa'imihim\",\n   \"en\": \"and hasten their Relief through the Rising Imam among them;\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَأَظْهِرْ إِعْزَازَهُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa azhir i`zazahu\",\n   \"en\": \"and make manifest Your fortifying him.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا مُحَمَّدُ يَا عَلِيُّ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya muhammadu ya `aliyyu\",\n   \"en\": \"O Muhammad! O `Ali!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا عَلِيُّ يَا مُحَمَّدُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya `aliyyu ya muhammadu\",\n   \"en\": \"O `Ali! O Muhammad!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"إِكْفِيَانِي فَإنَّكُمَا كَافِيَايَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ikfiyani fa'innakuma kafiyaya\",\n   \"en\": \"Save me, for you both are true saviors of me.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا مُحَمَّدُ يَا عَلِيُّ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya muhammadu ya `aliyyu\",\n   \"en\": \"O Muhammad! O `Ali!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا عَلِيُّ يَا مُحَمَّدُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya `aliyyu ya muhammadu\",\n   \"en\": \"O `Ali! O Muhammad!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"أُنْصُرَانِي فَإنَّكُمَا نَاصِرَايَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"unsurani fa'innakuma nasiraya\",\n   \"en\": \"Aid me, for you both are true aides of me.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا مُحَمَّدُ يَا عَلِيُّ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya muhammadu ya `aliyyu\",\n   \"en\": \"O Muhammad! O `Ali!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا عَلِيُّ يَا مُحَمَّدُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya `aliyyu ya muhammadu\",\n   \"en\": \"O `Ali! O Muhammad!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"إِحْفَظَانِي فَإنَّكُمَا حَافِظَايَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ihfazani fa'innakuma hafizaya\",\n   \"en\": \"Protect me, for you both are true protectors of me.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَامَوْلاَيَ يَا صَاحِبَ ٱلزَّمَانِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya mawlaya ya sahiba alzzamani\",\n   \"en\": \"O my master, the Patron of the Age!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا مَوْلاَيَ يَا صَاحِبَ ٱلزَّمَانِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya mawlaya ya sahiba alzzamani\",\n   \"en\": \"O my master, the Patron of the Age!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا مَوْلاَيَ يَا صَاحِبَ ٱلزَّمَانِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"ya mawlaya ya sahiba alzzamani\",\n   \"en\": \"O my master, the Patron of the Age!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"الْغَوْثَ ٱلْغَوْثَ ٱلْغَوْثَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"alghawtha alghawtha alghawtha\",\n   \"en\": \"Help, help, help!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"أَدْرِكْنِي أَدْرِكْنِي أَدْرِكْنِي\",\n   \"tr\": \"adrikni adrikni adrikni\",\n   \"en\": \"[come to] succor me, [come to] succor me, [come to] succor me!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"ٱلأَمَانَ ٱلأَمَانَ ٱلأَمَانَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"al-amana al-amana al-amana\",\n   \"en\": \"[grant me] security, [grant me] security, [grant me] security!\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَللَّهُمَّ اِنْ اَطَعْتُكَ فَالْمَحْمَدَةُ لَكَ،\",\n   \"tr\": \"Allaahumma in at’a’tuka fal mah’madatu lak.\",\n   \"en\": \"O Allah, if I obey You, then the essence of praise is for You,\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ إِنْ عَصَيْتُكَ فَالْحُجَّةُ لَكَ،\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa in as’aituka falh’ujjatu lak.\",\n   \"en\": \"and if I disobey You then the Proof is for You.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"مِنْكَ الرَّوْحُ وَ مِنْكَ الْفَرَجُ،\",\n   \"tr\": \"Minkar rauh’u wa minkal faraj.\",\n   \"en\": \"From You is comfort and from You is success.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"سُبْحَانَ مَنْ اَنْعَمَ وَ شَكَرَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Sub-h’aana man an-a’ma wa shakara\",\n   \"en\": \"Glory be to the one who has bestowed favors and thanked.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"سُبْحَانَ مَنْ قَدَّرَ وَ غَفَرَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"sub-h’aana man qaddara wa ghafara\",\n   \"en\": \"Glory be to the One who commanded and forgave.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اللَّهُمَّ إِنْ كُنْتُ عَصَيْتُكَ فَإنِّیْ قَدْ اَطَعْتُكَ فِىْ اَحَبِّ اْلاَشْيَاءِ إِلَيْكَ وَ هُوَ الإِيْمَانُ بِكَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"llaahumma in kuntu a’s’aituka fa-innee qad at’a’tuka fee ah’abbil ashyaa-i ilaika wahuwal eemaanu bika\",\n   \"en\": \"O Allah, if I am disobedient to you, then I indeed I have also obeyed You in those matters that You prefer most, and it is belief (faith) in You.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"لَمْ اَتَّخِذْ لَك وَلَدًا وَّ لَمْ اَدْعُ لَك شَرِيْكًا\",\n   \"tr\": \"lam attakhidh laka waladanw wa lam ad-u’ laka shareekam\",\n   \"en\": \"I have not taken for You any son and neither have I considered anyone Your partner\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"مَنًّا مِنْكَ بِهِ عَلَىَّ لاَ مَنَّا مِنِّیْ بِهِ عَلَيْكَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"mannaa minka bihi a’layya laa mannam minni bihi a’laika\",\n   \"en\": \"even then the favor is from you upon me and there is no favor from me upon You.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ قَدْ عَصَيْتُكَ يَا إِلٰهِىْ عَلٰی غَيْرِ وَجْهِ الْمُكَابَرَةِ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa qad a’s’aituka yaa ilaahee a’laa ghairi wajhil mukaabarati\",\n   \"en\": \"Also I have indeed disobeyed You O My Allah, this disobedience was not due to pride\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ لاَ الْخُرُوْجِ عَنْ عُبُوْدِيَّتِكَ وَ لاَ الْجُحُوْدِ لِرُبُوْبِيَّتِكَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa lal khurooji a’n u’boodeeyatika wa lal juh’oodi liruboobeeyatika\",\n   \"en\": \"or due to leaving Your worship or due to the denial of Allah.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ لٰكِنْ اَطَعْتُ هَوٰاىَ وَ اَزَلَّنِيْ الشَّيْطَانُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa laakin at’a’tu hawaaya wa azallanish shait’aanu\",\n   \"en\": \"It is only that I have obeyed my desires and the Satan misled me.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"فَلَكَ الْحُجَّةُ عَلَىَّ وَ الْبَيَانُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"falakal h’ujjatu a’layya wal bayaanu\",\n   \"en\": \"Then Your proof is complete upon me and Your decision.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"فَإِنْ تُعَذِّبْنِيْ فَبِذُنُوْبِىْ غَيْرُ ظَالِمٍ لِىْ،\",\n   \"tr\": \"fa-in tuadhdhibnee fabidhunoobee ghairu z’aalimil lee.\",\n   \"en\": \"Then if You punish me for my sins, You would not be unjust to me.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ إِنْ تَغْفِرْ لِىْ وَ تَرْحَمْنِيْ فَإِنَّكَ جَوَادٌ كَرِيْمٌ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa in taghfirlee wa tarh’amnee fa-innaka jawaadun kareemun\",\n   \"en\": \"But if You forgive me and have mercy on me, then indeed You are the Generous, the Kind,\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا كَرِيْمُ يَا كَرِيْمُ...\",\n   \"tr\": \"yaa kareemun yaa kareem.\",\n   \"en\": \"O Kind O Kind ….\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا آمِنًا مِنْ كُلِّ شَیْءٍ وَ كُلُّ شَىْءٍ مِنْكَ خَائِفٌ حَذِرٌ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Yaa aaminam min kulli shai-inw wa kullu shai-im minka khaa-ifun h’adhirun\",\n   \"en\": \"O One Who is safe from everything and everything is fearful of Him.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَسْاَلُكَ بِاَمْنِكَ مِنْ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ وَ خَوْفِ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ مِنْك\",\n   \"tr\": \"as-aluka bi-amnika min kulli shai-inw wa khaufi kulli shai-im minka\",\n   \"en\": \"I ask in the name of this safety and in the name of the fearfulness of everything\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَنْ تُصَلِّىَ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\",\n   \"tr\": \"an tus’alliya a’laa muh’ammadinw wa aali muh’ammad.\",\n   \"en\": \"that You bless Muhammad and the Progeny of Muhammad\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ اَنْ تُعْطِيَنِيْ اَمَانًا لِنَفْسِىْ وَ اَهْلِىْ وَ وَلَدِىْ وَ سَائِرِ مَا اَنْعَمْتَ بِهِ عَلَىَّ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa antut’ t’iyanee amaanal linafsee wa ahlee wa waladee wa saa-iri maa an-a’mta bihi a’layya\",\n   \"en\": \"and accord me safety in my self, my family and my children,\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"حَتَّی لاَ اَخَافَ وَ لاَ اَحْذَرَ مِنْ شَىْءٍ اَبَدًا\",\n   \"tr\": \"h’atta laa akhaafa wa laa ah’dhara min shai-in abadan\",\n   \"en\": \"so in me also no fear remains of anything, ever.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"إِنَّكَ عَلٰی كُلِّ شَیْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\",\n   \"tr\": \"innaka a’laa kulli shai-in qadeer.\",\n   \"en\": \"You are powerful over everything\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"وَ حَسْبُنَا اللهُ وَ نِعْمَ الْوَكِيْلُ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Wa h’asbunallaahu wa ni’mal wakeel.\",\n   \"en\": \"and Allah is sufficient for us and the best of the executors.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"يَا كَافِىَ إبْرَاهِيْمَ نَمْرُوْدَ وَ يَا كَافِىَ مُوْسٰی فِرْعَوْنَ\",\n   \"tr\": \"Yaa kaafiya ibraaheema numrooda wa yaa kaafiya moosaa fira’una\",\n   \"en\": \"O one who sufficed for Ibrahim against Nimrod and sufficed for Musa against Pharaoh.\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَسْاَلَُكَ اَنْ تُصَلِّىَ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ وَ آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\",\n   \"tr\": \"as-aluka antus’alliya a’laa muh’ammadinw wa aali muh’ammadinw\",\n   \"en\": \"I beseech You that You bless Muhammad and the Progeny of Muhammad\"\n  },\n  {\n   \"ar\": \"اَنْ تَكْفِيَنِيْ شَرَّ فُلاَنَ بْنَ فُلاَنٍ.\",\n   \"tr\": \"wa antakfiyanee sharra fulaanabna fulaan.\",\n   \"en\": \"and be sufficient for me against the mischief of the enemy.\"\n  }\n ]\n}"